1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
At her peak — she just stopped.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,300
Li Ziqi: quiet films of farm life and old crafts.

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,500
Early 2021: a Guinness World Record.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,900
14 million+ subscribers, later 20 million+.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,500
July 2021 — the videos stop.

6
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,800
A reported dispute over her own name.

7
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,400
Nov 2024 — she returns.

8
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,900
One video: 100 million+ views in hours.

9
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:44,600
Quit at the top, or keep posting? You decide.
